<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>示例论坛</title><link rel="self" href="https://forum.example/index.xml"/><link rel="alternate" href="https://forum.example/"/><id>https://forum.example/</id><updated>2026-10-31T09:00:00Z</updated>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 1 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2001#reply1"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2001</id>
<published>2026-10-31T01:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T01:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user1</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;最开始的问题是光照，朝东的阳台只有上午能晒到太阳，过了中午整片花盆就落在楼房的影子里。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 2 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2002#reply2"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2002</id>
<published>2026-10-31T02:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T02:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user2</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;我把每天几点有光记在一个小本子上，一个月下来才发现，夏天和春天的光线角度差得比想象中多。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 3 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2003#reply3"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2003</id>
<published>2026-10-31T03:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T03:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user3</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;浇水也不是越勤越好，泡沫箱底部没有打孔的那一个，番茄的根很快就闷坏了，叶子从下往上一片片发黄。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 4 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2004#reply4"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2004</id>
<published>2026-10-31T04:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T04:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user4</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;后来我改成早晚各看一次土，手指插进去两个指节，摸着干了才浇，摸着还潮就再等一等。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 5 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2005#reply5"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2005</id>
<published>2026-10-31T05:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T05:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user5</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;邻居家的阿姨送来一袋自己沤的肥，味道很冲，但两周之后辣椒明显精神了许多，开出一串串小白花。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 6 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2006#reply6"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2006</id>
<published>2026-10-31T06:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T06:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user6</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;最难对付的是蚜虫，它们躲在嫩芽背面，等你发现的时候往往已经密密麻麻一大片。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 7 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2007#reply7"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2007</id>
<published>2026-10-31T07:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T07:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user7</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;我试过用稀释的肥皂水喷，也试过把大蒜泡水，效果都有，但都得连续喷上好几天才压得下去。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 8 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2008#reply8"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2008</id>
<published>2026-10-31T08:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T08:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user8</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;收第一颗番茄那天正好下雨，我站在窗边把它摘下来，表皮还带着水珠，切开以后满屋子都是那股青涩的香气。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 9 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2009#reply9"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2009</id>
<published>2026-10-31T09:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T09:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user9</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;回头看这一年，真正学会的不是哪一种技巧，而是耐心地看，每天花五分钟蹲在花盆前面，什么也不做，只是看。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 10 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2010#reply10"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2010</id>
<published>2026-10-31T00:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T00:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user10</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;植物不会说话，但它会用叶子的颜色、茎的粗细、花开的早晚，一点一点告诉你它过得好不好。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 11 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2011#reply11"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2011</id>
<published>2026-10-31T01:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T01:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user11</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;今年我打算再加两只箱子，试试种豆角，顺便给爬藤搭一个竹竿架子，看看能不能把整面栏杆都铺满。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 12 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2012#reply12"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2012</id>
<published>2026-10-31T02:00:00Z</published><updated>2026-10-31T02:00:00Z</updated><author><name>user12</name></author>
<content type="html">&lt;p&gt;去年春天我在阳台上摆了三只泡沫箱，原本只想种几棵葱，后来越种越多，番茄、辣椒、薄荷都挤了进来。&lt;/p&gt;</content></entry>
<entry><title>[讨论] 第 13 个话题</title><link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://forum.example/t/2013#reply13"/><id>tag:forum.example,2026:/t/2013</id>
